.TH AIO-GUI 1 "August 2026" "aio 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aio-gui \- aio graphical user interface (tkinter)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aio --gui
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a tkinter window with a notebook of four tabs, one per game source,
each titled with its entry count:
.TP
.B Built-in
pygame example games.
.TP
.B PyPI
pygame packages.
.TP
.B GitHub
pygame repositories (top by stars).
.TP
.B Awesome
the curated awesome-pygame list.
.SH BUTTONS
.TP
.B System Doctor
Runs the diagnostics and shows component availability.
.TP
.B Launch Selected
Launches the currently selected entry in a worker thread.
.TP
.B Install Selected
Installs the currently selected entry (PyPI packages via pip, GitHub and
awesome entries by cloning).
.TP
.B Open in Browser
Opens a relevant web page for the selection.
.TP
.B Exit
Closes the window.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aio (1),
.BR aio-wui (1),
.BR aio-suite (7)
.SH AUTHOR
Jimmy + opencode
